# tally 2.1.8 P42, L §8.1 HOLE-SAME (group 4's review N3, agent/same3 sl): last over a class whose rows govern
# always and disagree names the day the read reads them for, differs on 2026-05-01, as the plain read at that law
# date does (pc). 4129d127 printed differs on 0001-01-01, the rows' carry start; the engine's differs on every day
# is no form of L §8.1's.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01

input px[u in currencies]: num PLN/u reading
input qx[u in currencies]: num PLN/u reading
input zx[u in currencies]: num PLN/u reading
input a: money PLN
input b: money PLN
input c: money PLN

version r
  cite s
  known 2026-03-09
  px[EUR] = 4.3 PLN/EUR at 2026-03-02
  qx[EUR] = 4.4 PLN/EUR at 2026-03-08
  zx[EUR] = 4.5 PLN/EUR at 2026-03-08

version r2
  cite s
  known 2026-04-01
  replace qx[EUR] = none at 2026-03-08
  replace zx[EUR] = none at 2026-03-08

version st
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = 1.00 PLN
  b = 2.00 PLN
  c = 3.00 PLN

version j
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  same zx[EUR] = qx[EUR]
  same c = b

version j2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  same px[EUR] = qx[EUR]
  same a = b

ask e: last(px[EUR], 2026-03-10), since(px[EUR], 2026-03-10) as known 2026-03-20
ask e2: last(px[EUR], 2026-03-10), since(px[EUR], 2026-03-10)
ask p8: px[EUR] law 2026-03-08 as known 2026-03-20
ask p8b: zx[EUR] law 2026-03-08
ask sa: a law 2026-05-01
ask sl: last(c, 2026-05-01)
ask pc: c law 2026-05-01
=== expect
e: (?"qx[EUR] and zx[EUR] are one, but the value differs on 2026-03-08: 4.4 PLN/EUR (r:qx[EUR]) and 4.5 PLN/EUR (r:zx[EUR])" (qx[EUR], zx[EUR]), 2)
  cut 2026-03-20
e2: (4.3 PLN/EUR, 8)
  held: px[EUR] = 4.3 PLN/EUR (r), read for 2026-03-10
  cut 2026-12-31
p8: ?"qx[EUR] and zx[EUR] are one, but the value differs on 2026-03-08: 4.4 PLN/EUR (r:qx[EUR]) and 4.5 PLN/EUR (r:zx[EUR])" (qx[EUR], zx[EUR])
  law date 2026-03-08, cut 2026-03-20
p8b: ?"zx[EUR] has no reading at 2026-03-08" (zx[EUR])
  law date 2026-03-08, cut 2026-12-31
pc: ?"a, b and c are one, but the value differs on 2026-05-01: 1.00 PLN (st:a), 2.00 PLN (st:b) and 3.00 PLN (st:c)" (a, b, c)
  law date 2026-05-01, cut 2026-12-31
sa: ?"a, b and c are one, but the value differs on 2026-05-01: 1.00 PLN (st:a), 2.00 PLN (st:b) and 3.00 PLN (st:c)" (a, b, c)
  law date 2026-05-01, cut 2026-12-31
sl: ?"a, b and c are one, but the value differs on 2026-05-01: 1.00 PLN (st:a), 2.00 PLN (st:b) and 3.00 PLN (st:c)" (a, b, c)
  cut 2026-12-31
